<title>CANADA: Veritas DGC Q1 net up after merger.</title>
<headline>Veritas DGC Q1 net up after merger.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter ended Oct 31:</p>
<p>			     1996			  1995</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.28		  US$0.10</p>
<p> Net			  5,168		    1,690</p>
<p> Revs			76,405		   59,824</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,382		   17,399</p>
<p>		  (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Included in Veritas DGC Inc's first quarter 1996 results was a charge of US$597,000 or US$0.03 per share reflecting expenses associated with closing the merger of Veritas Inc and Digicon Inc, which was effective August 30.</p>
<p>Average number of shares outstanding was restated to reflect the combination of the two companies. ((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
